Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 19:39:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] lane-296 B1: run25 close of OPEN 1 + OPEN 2 (protected-win
 resolutions)

OPEN 2 (sx8/q4_K hoist): arm order alternated x4, U8/R <= 1 or tie at every n,
sx8 n=2 U8 win; the run24 losses were the order confound. OPEN 1 (iq3_xxs
5120x6x17408): pooled 18 rounds +2.7% [0.8%, 4.7%], GPU-execution side, same
kernel/pipeline/dispatch as r86i; mechanism ASSUMED, bisect owed lane-298.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
